      "speaker": "client",
      "text": "The homepage looks great, and I also like the current gallery design. For the services page, could each listed service have a corresponding image—for example, photos, twilights, floor plans, and 3D views? Because this is primarily a photography business, every page should be highly visual and image-focused.\n\nPlease remove the monthly and annual tabs from the services page because all pricing is one-time only. For the bundles, could we have four spaces instead of 3? I would also like a large diagram showing every individual service we offer. Full pricing transparency is important so customers can see the exact breakdown and add individual items when needed. I have attached a PDF containing all items that must be included; most are categorized by both price and property square footage.\n\nThe main gallery only needs tabs for photos, twilights, videos, floor plans, and 3d tour. A smaller area could cover other photography since we sometimes accept one-off clients. During development of the actual website, could the gallery items also receive hover animations? Overall, the pages look excellent!"
